Key Features\nImmersive VR Physics: Feel every strike with intuitive hand gestures. Measure your speed and unleash devastating full-power hits. \ud83c\udfaf\ud83d\udcaa\n\nGlobal Tour Mode: Travel across international arenas including the USA \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8, Japan \ud83c\uddef\ud83c\uddf5, and England \ud83c\uddec\ud83c\udde7 to fight unique opponents and win belts. \ud83c\udf10\ud83c\udfc6\n\nGym Upgrades: Enhance your fighter stats by upgrading Health (HP+) and Damage (DMG+) to land record-breaking knockouts. \ud83d\udcc8\u2699\ufe0f\n\nGear Locker: Unlock exclusive skins, masks, rare gloves, and championship accessories from rewards and prize wheels. \ud83e\udde2\ud83d\udd76\ufe0f\ud83d\udc5f\n\n\ud83c\udfae How to Play\nStrike: Swing with your open hand at the exact right moment to maximize your damage multiplier. \ud83d\udd90\ufe0f\ud83d\udca5\n\nDodge: Use quick defensive movements right before your opponent strikes to avoid getting knocked out. \ud83d\udee1\ufe0f\ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\n\nConquer: Clear rounds, defeat regional bosses, and climb to the top of the leaderboards! \ud83c\udf1f\ud83e\udd47\n\nDownload Power Slap VR today and prove you have what it takes to land the ultimate slap! \ud83d\ude80\ud83c\udf89", "short_description": "Step into the virtual reality arena and unleash ultimate power! \ud83e\udd4a Master timing, land heavy open hand strikes, and dodge incoming blows to become the undisputed champion in this immersive Power Slap VR competition. \ud83d\udca5\ud83d\udd25"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://teamdigitalaesthet.wixsite.com/privacypolicy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Digital Aesthetics", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://teamdigitalaesthet.wixsite.com/privacypolicy", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_top